stage3/checked-writes/refused-optional-boolean.a:4:7: Adamic 0.1 refuses a value of type { readonly multiLine: true | undefined; } seen as { multiLine: boolean | undefined; }, whose readonly field multiLine becomes writable: a readonly field may hold something narrower than true | undefined, which a write of boolean | undefined would replace; keep multiLine readonly in the type it's seen as, or copy the value ({ ...value }) (adamic/invariant-mutable)
